      "w": 1055.968503937008,
      "h": 56,
      "text": "Background and research question",
      "font_size": 47
    },
    {
      "x": 95.0,
      "y": 684,
      "w": 1055.968503937008,
      "h": 138,
      "text": "EEG measures electrical activity at the scalp; fMRI BOLD reflects slower changes in blood oxygenation. Predicting BOLD from EEG could help monitor fluctuations in brain state.",
      "font_size": 35
    },
    {
      "x": 95.0,
      "y": 854,
      "w": 1055.968503937008,
      "h": 138,
      "text": "NeuroBOLT [1] combines spectral features with a pretrained transformer. Can an interpretable EEG model predict unseen people and generalise across sites?",
      "font_size": 35
    },
    {
      "x": 1232.968503937008,
      "y": 606,
      "w": 1055.968503937008,
      "h": 56,
      "text": "Methodology",
      "font_size": 47
    },
    {
      "x": 1232.968503937008,
      "y": 682,
      "w": 1055.968503937008,
      "h": 129,
      "text": "<b>VU:</b> 22 people, 29 eyes-closed scans (~20 min).<br/><b>External ds006040 [2]:</b> 28 people, 56 runs (~6 min), eyes closed and open; a different scanner and EEG cap.",
      "font_size": 33
    },
    {
      "x": 1232.968503937008,
      "y": 953,
      "w": 1055.968503937008,
      "h": 78,
      "text": "Five folds grouped by person; separate validation people for tuning. Frozen-model test at the new site. Mean <i>R</i> and 95% CIs over people.",
      "font_size": 31
    },
    {
      "x": 85.0,
      "y": 1194,
      "w": 1075.968503937008,
      "h": 56,
      "text": "1. Prediction in unseen people",
      "font_size": 47
    },
    {
      "x": 85.0,
      "y": 1738,
      "w": 1075.968503937008,
      "h": 92,
      "text": "Ridge led NeuroBOLT in <b>19/22 people</b>:<br/>ΔR = +0.045 (95% CI +0.023 to +0.067).",
      "font_size": 35
    },
    {
      "x": 85.0,
      "y": 1850,
      "w": 1075.968503937008,
      "h": 68,
      "text": "Seven targets: six DiFuMo regions + global BOLD. NeuroBOLT: shared 24 s model, three seeds. Vigilance index: alpha/(delta + theta) power.",
      "font_size": 27
    },
    {
      "x": 1222.968503937008,
      "y": 1194,
      "w": 1075.968503937008,
      "h": 56,
      "text": "2. Transfer to an independent site",
      "font_size": 47
    },
    {
      "x": 1222.968503937008,
      "y": 1738,
      "w": 1075.968503937008,
      "h": 92,
      "text": "Eyes closed: similar means for frozen and local models. Paired ΔR (local - frozen) = +0.001 (95% CI -0.017 to +0.020).",
      "font_size": 35
    },
    {
      "x": 1222.968503937008,
      "y": 1887,
      "w": 1075.968503937008,
      "h": 68,
      "text": "Published NeuroBOLT reached R = 0.180 with eyes closed. Eyes-open rest was harder for the frozen ridge model.",
      "font_size": 27
    },
    {
      "x": 85.0,
      "y": 2012,
      "w": 1075.968503937008,
      "h": 56,
      "text": "3. What carries the prediction?",
      "font_size": 47
    },
    {
      "x": 1222.968503937008,
      "y": 2012,
      "w": 1075.968503937008,
      "h": 56,
      "text": "4. Prototype: EEG arousal monitor",
      "font_size": 47
    },
    {
      "x": 85.0,
      "y": 2181,
      "w": 1075.968503937008,
      "h": 78,
      "text": "Mean R across the same 64 regions, before and after global-signal regression (GSR).",
      "font_size": 31
    },
    {
      "x": 85.0,
      "y": 2670,
      "w": 1075.968503937008,
      "h": 132,
      "text": "Alpha power couples negatively with global BOLD around 9 s earlier; the thalamus has a positive component around 3 s. This supports a brain-state interpretation, with regional differences.",
      "font_size": 34
    },
    {
      "x": 1222.968503937008,
      "y": 2547,
      "w": 1075.968503937008,
      "h": 68,
      "text": "Example: sub-008_EC (r = 0.28), closest to median eyes-closed accuracy. Gap = excluded EEG windows.",
      "font_size": 27
    },
    {
      "x": 1222.968503937008,
      "y": 2735,
      "w": 1075.968503937008,
      "h": 123,
      "text": "Streaming replay: 28 eyes-closed runs.<br/>95% CI 0.205 to 0.321; one CPU core.<br/>EEG estimates global BOLD; fMRI assesses accuracy.",
      "font_size": 32
    },
    {
      "x": 97.0,
      "y": 2929,
      "w": 1051.968503937008,
      "h": 56,
      "text": "Conclusion",
      "font_size": 47
    },
    {
      "x": 97.0,
      "y": 3004,
      "w": 1051.968503937008,
      "h": 176,
      "text": "Penalised linear models provide a strong baseline for EEG-to-BOLD prediction. Much of the predictable signal follows brain-wide state fluctuations. Transfer worked on one independent site; the model supports an arousal-monitor prototype.",
      "font_size": 34
    },
    {
      "x": 1234.968503937008,
      "y": 2929,
      "w": 1051.968503937008,
      "h": 56,
      "text": "Limitations and further research",
      "font_size": 47
    },
    {
      "x": 1234.968503937008,
      "y": 3004,
      "w": 1051.968503937008,
      "h": 176,
      "text": "Test region-specific prediction with respiration and motion controls at more sites. Validate arousal flags against pupil measurements or sleep staging. These are observational results; streaming used replayed, cleaned EEG. Prospective use remains untested.",
      "font_size": 34
    },
    {
      "x": 85.0,
      "y": 3249,
      "w": 1969.9370078740162,
      "h": 84,
      "text": "<b>[1]</b> Li et al. NeuroBOLT: Resting-state EEG-to-fMRI synthesis with multi-dimensional feature mapping. NeurIPS, 2024.<br/><b>[2]</b> Cha et al. Sustained attention task (gradCPT) dataset using simultaneous EEG-fMRI and DTI. Scientific Data, 2026. doi:10.1038/s41597-026-06616-6. OpenNeuro: ds006040.<br/>Analysis code, model weights and full reports: github.com/seamus-programming-stuff/NeuroBOLT",
      "font_size": 22
    }
  ]
}